      }
    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "MasRouter works by first determining the collaboration mode for a given query using a variational latent variable model. Then, it allocates roles to agents through a structured probabilistic cascade, taking into account the query, collaboration mode, and previously assigned roles. Finally, it routes each agent to an LLM based on the query, collaboration mode, and assigned role, using a multinomial distribution problem.",
