    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "Extensive experiments demonstrate that MasRouter is high-performing, economical, and plug-and-play. It achieves a 1.8% \u223c 8.2% improvement over state-of-the-art methods on the MBPP benchmark, reduces overhead by up to 52.07% on HumanEval, and seamlessly combines with mainstream multi-agent systems, reducing overhead by 17.21% \u223c 28.17%.",
